  "body": "Set on a substantial 809m² (more or less) freehold site, this property offers an exciting opportunity for home buyers, investors and land bankers.\r\n\r\nThe existing home provides a practical option to live in, rent out or hold for the future, while enjoying the benefits of a large section in a popular coastal location.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* 809m² (more or less) freehold land\r\n* Currently zoned Residential – Single House Zone\r\n* Existing 2-bedroom home\r\n* Great land-bank and future potential\r\n* Buyers are encouraged to investigate the potential implications of Auckland Council Plan Change 120\r\n* Close to Red Beach, Orewa and Silverdale\r\n* Easy access to motorway and public transport\r\n* Zoned for Red Beach School and Orewa College\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a sizeable freehold property in Red Beach with plenty of options for today and potential for tomorrow.\r\n\r\nContact Jason Li for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
